      "simplified": "大星的女朋友和猫玩。大星看他的女朋友和猫。",
      "traditional": "大星的女朋友和貓玩。大星看他的女朋友和貓。",
      "pinyin": "dà xīng de nǚ péng you hé māo wán dà xīng kàn tā de nǚ péng you hé māo",
      "english": "Daxing’s girlfriend was playing with the cat. Daxing watched his girlfriend and the cat."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "大星的爸爸和妈妈回家了，他们做BBQ。",
      "traditional": "大星的爸爸和媽媽回家了，他們做BBQ。",
      "pinyin": "dà xīng de bà ba hé mā ma huí jiā le tā men zuò 1",
      "english": "Daxing’s mom and dad came home. They cooked a barbecue."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "天气很好，他们很高兴。我没和他们在一起，我在书下面。",
      "traditional": "天氣很好，他們很高興。我沒和他們在一起，我在書下面。",
      "pinyin": "tiān qì hěn hǎo tā men hěn gāo xìng wǒ méi hé tā men zài yì qǐ wǒ zài shū xià miàn",
      "english": "The weather was very good. They were very happy. I was not together with them. I was underneath a book."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "我知道茶茶手机也来了，他和大星女朋友一起来了。",
      "traditional": "我知道茶茶手機也來了，他和大星女朋友一起來了。",
