      "english": "I knew Chacha was also here. He and Daxing’s girlfriend came together."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "现在茶茶和苹果在说话，他们没看见我，他们不知道我在书下面。",
      "traditional": "現在茶茶和蘋果在說話，他們沒看見我，他們不知道我在書下面。",
      "pinyin": "xiàn zài chá chá hé píng guǒ zài shuō huà tā men méi kàn jiàn wǒ tā men bù zhī dào wǒ zài shū xià miàn",
      "english": "Chacha and Apple were now talking. They hadn’t seen me. They don’t know I was under a book."
    },
