    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "“你这个星期怎么样？你的主人听你的吗？”茶茶问。",
      "traditional": "“你這個星期怎麼樣？你的主人聽你的嗎？”茶茶問。",
      "pinyin": "nǐ zhè ge xīng qī zěn me yàng nǐ de zhǔ rén tīng nǐ de ma chá chá wèn",
      "english": "“How have you been this week? Is your owner listening to you?” Chacha asked."
    },
    {
