      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "“她真的听我的。太好玩了！”苹果很高兴。",
      "traditional": "“她真的聽我的。太好玩了！”蘋果很高興。",
      "pinyin": "tā zhēn de tīng wǒ de tài hǎo wán le píng guǒ hěn gāo xìng",
      "english": "“She really did listen to me. It’s really fun!” Apple was very happy."
