    "sentence_translations": [
      "(7) Chacha Is Here",
      "",
      "It was now 12 noon on Sunday. Daxing’s girlfriend came to our house.",
      "",
      "Daxing’s girlfriend was playing with the cat. Daxing watched his girlfriend and the cat.",
      "Daxing’s mom and dad came home. They cooked a barbecue.",
      "The weather was very good. They were very happy. I was not together with them. I was underneath a book.",
      "",
      "I knew Chacha was also here. He and Daxing’s girlfriend came together.",
      "Chacha and Apple were now talking. They hadn’t seen me. They don’t know I was under a book.",
      "",
      "“Hello, Apple. I’m glad to see you,” Chacha said.",
      "",
      "“Hello, Chacha. I’m also glad to see you,” Apple said.",
      "",
      "“How have you been this week? Is your owner listening to you?” Chacha asked.",
      "",
      "“She really did listen to me. It’s really fun!” Apple was very happy."
    ]
